QindieGL — the Project Empty fork for You Are Empty

QindieGL, an OpenGL → Direct3D 9 wrapper, is by Crystice Softworks (2016;
XaeroX, crystice), with later work by whisperglen; this fork adds the changes
for You Are Empty (2026, the Project Empty contributors). It is under the GNU
General Public License, version 3, as upstream (LICENSE).

